{"id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-independence-type.md","title":"Types of Independence and Their Realizations","display":"df-independence-type — Types of Independence and Their Realizations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-independence-type","aliases":["67-df-independence-type"],"display":"df-independence-type — Types of Independence and Their Realizations","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":3,"source_label":"§2 definitions of type, realization, and positively prime","source_printed_pages":"45–46","source_pdf_pages":"56–57","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"定义已与原书核对；有限树递归的存在唯一性作本地核对","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-independence-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-independence-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-independence-type — Types of Independence and Their Realizations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"§2 definitions of type, realization, and positively prime"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"45–46"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"56–57"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"定义已与原书核对；有限树递归的存在唯一性作本地核对"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；句子与外部可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。以下命题公式是元层有限带标签树；标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2\">\\(0,1,2\\)</span> 分别区分变量、否定、合取构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义。</li>\n<li>固定该有限树语法的自然原始递归编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathrm{Prop}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathrm{Prop}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_1\\)</span> 是自然数集合的递归可枚举性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_v:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(V_v:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(R_\\Phi:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是以下有限树递归所定义的求值与句法代入函数；递归右端的子树深度严格小于输入树。对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land\">\\(\\neg,\\land\\)</span> 使用既定算术句法构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(s,j)\">\\(D(s,j)\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\le|s|\">\\(j\\le|s|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span> 在命题树上按下式展开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T,\\mathrm{PP}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T,\\mathrm{PP}\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(x)\">\\(\\xi(x)\\)</span> 是至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 是数词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\np_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&amp;N(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&amp;C(P,Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nH_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nH_{j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq H_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in H_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in H_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}H_j,\\\\\n\\neg P&amp;\\coloneqq N(P),&amp;P\\land Q&amp;\\coloneqq C(P,Q),&amp;P\\lor Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg P\\land\\neg Q),\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq v(n),&amp;V_v(\\neg P)&amp;\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&amp;V_v(P\\land Q)&amp;\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&amp;R_\\Phi(\\neg P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&amp;R_\\Phi(P\\land Q)&amp;\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q),\\\\\nD(s,0)&amp;\\coloneqq p_0\\land\\neg p_0,&amp;D(s,j+1)&amp;\\coloneqq D(s,j)\\lor p_{s(j)}\\quad(j&lt;|s|).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\np_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&amp;N(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&amp;C(P,Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nH_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nH_{j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq H_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in H_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in H_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}H_j,\\\\\n\\neg P&amp;\\coloneqq N(P),&amp;P\\land Q&amp;\\coloneqq C(P,Q),&amp;P\\lor Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg P\\land\\neg Q),\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq v(n),&amp;V_v(\\neg P)&amp;\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&amp;V_v(P\\land Q)&amp;\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&amp;R_\\Phi(\\neg P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&amp;R_\\Phi(P\\land Q)&amp;\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q),\\\\\nD(s,0)&amp;\\coloneqq p_0\\land\\neg p_0,&amp;D(s,j+1)&amp;\\coloneqq D(s,j)\\lor p_{s(j)}\\quad(j&lt;|s|).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(h[F])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\forall P\\in F\\ (V_v(P)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ ((\\forall Q\\in F\\ V_v(Q)=1)\\Longrightarrow V_v(P)=1)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow P\\in F\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Realizes}_T(\\Phi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}^{\\mathbb N}\\land\nF=\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:T\\vdash R_\\Phi(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Realizes}_T((\\xi(\\bar n))_{n\\in\\mathbb N},F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PP}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl[(0&lt;|s|\\land D(s,|s|)\\in F)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists i&lt;|s|\\ (p_{s(i)}\\in F)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(h[F])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\forall P\\in F\\ (V_v(P)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ ((\\forall Q\\in F\\ V_v(Q)=1)\\Longrightarrow V_v(P)=1)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow P\\in F\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Realizes}_T(\\Phi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}^{\\mathbb N}\\land\nF=\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:T\\vdash R_\\Phi(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Realizes}_T((\\xi(\\bar n))_{n\\in\\mathbb N},F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PP}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl[(0&lt;|s|\\land D(s,|s|)\\in F)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists i&lt;|s|\\ (p_{s(i)}\\in F)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 pp.45–46 的 type 是一致、r.e.、对重言式后承封闭的命题公式集；实现要求精确恢复全部可证命题组合，不能仅保持正面成员。这里用显式有限树和真值赋值表达命题后承；经典命题紧致性使这与原书的有限重言式后承闭包对应。只选否定与合取为原始构造不会改变该命题语言的表达能力。</p>\n<p>带标签构造互不相交且有唯一分解；子树深度下降给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_v,R_\\Phi\">\\(V_v,R_\\Phi\\)</span> 的存在唯一性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是有限长度递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PP}\">\\(\\mathrm{PP}\\)</span> 保留“正变量有限析取中至少一个变量已经属于 F”的精确条件，并不是通常的完整性或任意析取素性。</p>\n<p>创建前已搜索本册全部原子及相邻册命题公式候选：第57册命题原子是固定一阶原子公式，第62册采用其内部二阶数码语境；没有直接混接这些对象。此处最小本地命题树接口供本册 Theorems 3.4–3.5 稳定复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；句子与外部可推导性见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-prim-provability]]。以下命题公式是元层有限带标签树；标签 $0,1,2$ 分别区分变量、否定、合取构造。$p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}$ 在 Assertion 中定义。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；句子与外部可推导性见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-prim-provability]]。以下命题公式是元层有限带标签树；标签 $0,1,2$ 分别区分变量、否定、合取构造。$p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}$ 在 Assertion 中定义。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定该有限树语法的自然原始递归编码 $h:\\mathrm{Prop}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{RE}_1$ 是自然数集合的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}$，$v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2","display":false},{"tex":"p_n,N(P),C(P,Q),H_j,\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathrm{Prop}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_1","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"V_v:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land","display":false},{"tex":"D(s,j)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\le|s|","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T,\\mathrm{PP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\np_n&\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&N(P)&\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&C(P,Q)&\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nH_0&\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nH_{j+1}&\\coloneqq H_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in H_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in H_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}H_j,\\\\\n\\neg P&\\coloneqq N(P),&P\\land Q&\\coloneqq C(P,Q),&P\\lor Q&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg P\\land\\neg Q),\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&\\coloneqq v(n),&V_v(\\neg P)&\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&V_v(P\\land Q)&\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&R_\\Phi(\\neg P)&\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&R_\\Phi(P\\land Q)&\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q),\\\\\nD(s,0)&\\coloneqq p_0\\land\\neg p_0,&D(s,j+1)&\\coloneqq D(s,j)\\lor p_{s(j)}\\quad(j<|s|).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(h[F])\\\\\n&\\land\\exists v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\forall P\\in F\\ (V_v(P)=1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ ((\\forall Q\\in F\\ V_v(Q)=1)\\Longrightarrow V_v(P)=1)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow P\\in F\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Realizes}_T(\\Phi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}^{\\mathbb N}\\land\nF=\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:T\\vdash R_\\Phi(P)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T(\\xi,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\mathrm{Realizes}_T((\\xi(\\bar n))_{n\\in\\mathbb N},F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PP}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\mathrm{Type}(F)\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\ \\bigl[(0<|s|\\land D(s,|s|)\\in F)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists i<|s|\\ (p_{s(i)}\\in F)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V_v,R_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PP}","display":false}],"bytes":4858,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ee4c58635b96fc1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 为一致原始递归公理呈示，$F$ 满足 [[67-df-independence-type]] 的 $\\mathrm{Type}(F)$；其 $\\mathrm{Realizes}_T,\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T$ 使用同一命题树与算术句法代入。"},{"id":"4b301a7129d70d59","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示，$F$ 是 $\\mathrm{Type}(F)$；$\\mathrm{Type},\\mathrm{PP},\\mathrm{FormulaType}_T$ 见 [[67-df-independence-type]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-independence-type]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-independence-type]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-numeration-existence]]；[[../67-thm-disjoint-numerations]]；[[../67-df-independent-formula]]；[[../67-df-independence-type]]；[[../67-thm-independence-type-realization]]；[[../67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","573b4c635ea6d91f","b59d5ff6e43660a9"]}